{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56157","headline":"三啓颂 一 · 杜光庭","name":"三啓颂 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乐法以爲妻，爱经如珠玉。\n持戒制六情。\n念道遣所欲。\n淡泊正气停，萧然神静默。\n天魔并敬护，世世享大福。\n（同上一卷。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56157.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56157","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}